│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ fix_collapse_and_add_momentum_features                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ The current model suffers from prediction collapse (pred_std_ratio = 0.009), which        │
│                          │ triggers a high penalty and lowers the score. This edit increases model expressivity by   │
│                          │ increasing `max_depth` and `learning_rate` while reducing regularization                  │
│                          │ (`min_child_weight`, `reg_lambda`).                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Additionally, I've added several high-signal features:                                    │
│                          │ 1. Z-scores for returns, volume, and price to normalize across volatility regimes.        │
│                          │ 2. Exponential Moving Average (EMA) distances and spreads to capture trend and            │
│                          │ mean-reversion signals.                                                                   │
│                          │ 3. Log-returns and momentum indicators.                                                   │
│                          │ 4. Funding rate momentum (diff).                                                          │
│                          │ 5. Volatility momentum.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes aim to help the model distinguish between different market states and       │
│                          │ increase the variance of its predictions, thereby fixing the collapse and improving       │
│                          │ directional accuracy.                                                                     │
