│ patch_description        │ The current model suffers from severe prediction collapse (pred_std_ratio=0.0185) despite │
│                          │ achieving reasonable val_DA. This is caused by over-regularization that suppresses the    │
│                          │ model's expressivity.                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
