│                          │ the gradient, making the target distribution easier for the model to map.                 │
│                          │ 3. Lowering the MIN_PRED_STD_RATIO threshold to 0.05 to reduce the collapse penalty while │
│                          │ the model learns to be more 'brave' in its predictions.                                   │
│                          │ 4. Adding high-signal microstructure and momentum features: Chaikin Money Flow (CMF), log │
│                          │ volume, volume shocks, price z-scores, and distance-from-extremes (max/min) indicators.   │
│                          │ 5. Retaining the successful regime-conditional RSI features while streamlining            │
