│                          │ This proposal:                                                                            │
│                          │ 1. Significanty reduces regularization (min_child_weight, reg_alpha, reg_lambda) and      │
│                          │ increases the learning rate (0.015 -> 0.05) to increase model expressivity and force a    │
│                          │ higher prediction variance.                                                               │
│                          │ 2. Increases CLIP_PERCENTILE from 95 to 98 to retain more information from the tails of   │
│                          │ the distribution.                                                                         │
│                          │ 3. Adds 'momentum persistence' (streak_5) and 'vwap distance' normalized by ATR to        │
│                          │ provide clearer mean-reversion and trend-continuation signals.                            │
│                          │ 4. Optimizes the OBI calculation to avoid slow row-wise apply() calls, ensuring execution │
