│ patch_name               │ aggressive_capacity_signal_boost                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ This edit aggressively reduces regularization and increases model capacity to combat the  │
│                          │ collapse penalty. The strategy:                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Hyperparameters**: Reduce reg_lambda from 0.5 to 0.15, increase max_depth from 5 to  │
│                          │ 6, boost learning_rate from 0.05 to 0.08, increase n_estimators to 1200, and reduce       │
│                          │ min_child_weight to 1 to allow more expressive trees.                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Features**: Remove low-signal features (MACD, some redundant momentum variants) and  │
│                          │ add high-signal microstructure features:                                                  │
│                          │    - Candle body direction and wick imbalance (strong microstructure signals)             │
│                          │    - Multi-scale volatility ratios (vol_5/vol_20, vol_20/vol_60) for regime detection     │
│                          │    - Return quantile position (rank-based, scale-invariant)                               │
│                          │    - Direction persistence (sign consistency over windows)                                │
│                          │    - Volatility-adjusted returns (return / vol normalization)                             │
│                          │    - Simpler, more direct interactions (vol_state × momentum, range_pos × volume)         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Target clipping**: Increase CLIP_PERCENTILE from 98 to 96 to allow the model to      │
│                          │ learn from more extreme moves without clipping too aggressively.                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The goal is to increase pred_std_ratio from 0.04 to 0.08+ while maintaining val_DA ≥      │
│                          │ 0.51.                                                                                     │
