│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ deregularize_and_accelerate                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ The model is suffering from severe prediction collapse (pred_std_ratio=0.08) despite      │
│                          │ increasingly complex features. This indicates the regularization is too aggressive,       │
│                          │ suppressing the model's ability to express market signals. The solution is to:            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Eliminate L2 regularization (reg_lambda=0) and L1 regularization (reg_alpha=0) to      │
│                          │ allow full expressivity                                                                   │
│                          │ 2. Increase learning_rate from 0.05 to 0.15 for faster convergence and stronger signal    │
│                          │ capture                                                                                   │
│                          │ 3. Reduce n_estimators from 1200 to 400 to prevent overfitting when regularization is     │
