│ patch_description        │ The current model has pred_std_ratio=0.04, indicating severe prediction collapse.         │
│                          │ Previous attempts show that both high and low regularization result in collapse,          │
│                          │ suggesting the issue is under-expressivity rather than regularization.                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit increases model capacity through:                                               │
│                          │ 1. Deeper trees (max_depth 6→8) to capture non-linear patterns                            │
│                          │ 2. More estimators (1200→1500) for ensemble diversity                                     │
│                          │ 3. Slightly reduced learning rate (0.18→0.12) to allow better convergence with deeper     │
│                          │ trees                                                                                     │
│                          │ 4. New higher-order interaction features that combine regime signals with                 │
│                          │ momentum/volatility                                                                       │
│                          │ 5. Micro-regime features capturing 15-min market structure (very short-term vol           │
│                          │ acceleration, momentum consistency)                                                       │
│                          │ 6. Ratio and difference features that may reveal directional bias                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These targeted features focus on combining existing signals in new ways rather than       │
│                          │ adding many independent features, keeping feature count manageable while increasing model │
│                          │ signal clarity.                                                                           │
