│ patch_description        │ The current model suffers from a significant 'collapse toward mean' (pred_std_ratio =     │
│                          │ 0.056), indicating it is over-regularized or lacks sufficient signal to distinguish       │
│                          │ directional moves.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I am proposing the following changes:                                                     │
│                          │ 1.  **Increase Model Expressivity**:                                                      │
│                          │     - Reduced `reg_alpha` (0.05 -> 0.01) and `reg_lambda` (0.5 -> 0.1) to allow the model │
│                          │ to fit more complex patterns.                                                             │
│                          │     - Increased `max_depth` (6 -> 7) and `learning_rate` (0.05 -> 0.06) to boost the      │
│                          │ model's ability to capture non-linearities.                                               │
│                          │     - Added `colsample_bynode` (0.8) and increased `n_estimators` (800 -> 1000) to        │
│                          │ improve ensemble diversity and capacity.                                                  │
│                          │     - Increased `CLIP_PERCENTILE` (98.0 -> 99.0) to expose the model to more of the       │
│                          │ target distribution's tails.                                                              │
│                          │ 2.  **Enhance Feature Signal**:                                                           │
│                          │     - Added interaction features (`trend_x_vol`, `breakout_pressure`) to capture          │
│                          │ regime-dependent behaviors.                                                               │
│                          │     - Added acceleration and momentum-slope features (`ret_accel_6_24`, `mom_slope_24`)   │
│                          │ to identify trend exhaustion or strengthening.                                            │
│                          │     - Added distance-from-mean features (`z_close_24`) and efficiency metrics             │
│                          │ (`efficiency_10`) to capture mean-reversion and trend quality.                            │
│                          │     - Added `vol_of_vol_20` and `range_z_20` to better define volatility regimes.         │
│                          │     - Added `obi_diff` and `funding_change` to capture shifts in market microstructure    │
│                          │ and sentiment.                                                                            │
