│ patch_name               │ model_expressivity_and_vol_scaled_features                                                │
│ patch_description        │ To address the 'predictions collapsed toward mean' warning (low pred_std_ratio), I am     │
│                          │ increasing model expressivity by raising max_depth to 7 and decreasing the learning rate  │
│                          │ while increasing the number of estimators. This allows the gradient boosting process to   │
│                          │ fit more complex patterns across a larger number of smaller steps.                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ On the feature engineering side, I am introducing:                                        │
│                          │ 1. Volatility-adjusted momentum (Sharpe-like ratios) to better capture movement quality   │
│                          │ relative to noise.                                                                        │
│                          │ 2. Efficiency Ratio (Fractal efficiency) to distinguish between trending and range-bound  │
│                          │ regimes.                                                                                  │
│                          │ 3. Volatility Acceleration to capture explosive regime shifts.                            │
│                          │ 4. Range standardization (Z-score of candle range) to detect abnormal price behavior.     │
│                          │ 5. Improved time features (adding week periodicity).                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes aim to provide the model with higher variance, high-signal inputs,          │
│                          │ improving the prediction spread and directional accuracy.                                 │
